  "ruleText": "Bea 403.04 Failure to Comply. Failure to provide any of the information as noted in Bea 404.05 shall result in denial of a BMGI grant in accordance with RSA 541-A:29.Source. #13515, INTERIM, eff 1-5-23, EXPIRES: 7-4-23",
